OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after being hit by
OL,4,Alorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian has died after being hit
OL,7,Fby a lorry in Lincoln.
OL,9,FLincolnshire Police said the incident
OL,10,Fhappened on the A15 Brigg Road, near
OL,11,Fthe Riseholme Roundabout, at about
OL,12,F11:15 BST on Friday.
OL,14,FThe pedestrian - a man - was pronounced
OL,15,Fdead at the scene, the force added.
OL,17,FIt appealed for witnesses or anyone
OL,18,Fwith dashcam footage to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
